sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant RN as React Native App
  participant API as Medusa Orders API
  participant WF as createFieldOrder Workflow
  participant Visit as Visit Module
  participant Commerce as Medusa Commerce Modules
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Audit as Audit Module
  RN->>API: POST /api/v1/orders/field
  API->>API: Validate tenant, rep role and idempotency key
  API->>WF: outlet, visit, line items
  WF->>Visit: Verify assigned outlet/visit context
  WF->>Commerce: Create cart/order using product, price and inventory modules
  Commerce->>PG: Persist order and inventory effects
  WF->>Audit: order.field_created
  API-->>RN: Order confirmation and sync cursor
